Cross-recorded from app-game WP20.

Native app coverage in the shared parent-domain contracts:

- native-app-session inputs can be counted independently from native-game and
  launcher-game-candidate inputs;
- all-native-apps, native-app, app-category, and risk-app targets are supported;
- running-time and foreground-only budget modes remain separate;
- app budget decisions require stored session refs, schedule evidence refs, and
  policy preview evidence refs;
- bonus time requires approval and audit refs before extending the effective
  app budget;
- exceeded budgets remain dry-run, ask-parent, or manual-required until a later
  runtime/enforcement slice proves adapter execution.
